        },
        {
          "text": "Malaikaani qara magalata ufi d'oofte. Bokaa d'akha roobufi ibidi ka d'iigaani wolkeesa makhame lafati jige. Qoodi sadeeso ka lafa gubate, qoodi sadeeso ka mukhaleeni gubate, buyuo dooti ch'ufa gubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.7",
