        {
          "text": "Jennaani malaikaani afreeso magalata ufi d'oofte. Qooda sadeeso ka jiatifi ka urjile wa d'aani. Duuba akanaani qoodi sadeeso ka waan kana sadeeni ifse d'abe; qoodi sadeeso ka guyyatiifi ka halkanileeni ifsu dide.",
          "type": "text",
